arty","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:13","title":"达人分销✅头部达人专场合作攻略🔥。⭕头部达人专场合作是品牌方在短期内实现品效双爆的核心手段，但同时也是成本与风险高度集中的“大考”。成功的关键在于：选对人、算好账、造好势、控好场。 . 📌以下从实操角度拆解这份合作攻略： . ✅一、 认知篇：为什么要做专场？ . ✅二、 选人篇：矩阵策略与精准匹配 . ✅三、 算账篇：费用结构与ROI控制 . ✅四、 执行篇：全链路SOP（标准化操作流程） . ✅","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7653704017524127414","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7653704017524127414","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:14","title":"如何做好小红书达播BD? | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/share/6389874.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/share/6389874.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:15","title":"MKT科普，达人种草推广全流程SOP #达人投放","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:16","title":"把你划掉的不是主播是运营。","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680928762053020970","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680928762053020970","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:17","title":"抖音直播任务-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/109137","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/109137","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:18","title":"2026 年双十一，怎么样让更多达人带货。⭕下面给你一套2026 双十一达人分销全域作战方案，按 \"定位→平台分工→达人分层→货品佣金→素材供给→BD 建联→节奏排期→风控\" 八个模块展开，大部分类目通用。 . ✅一、整体定位：达人分销承接大促 GMV 的 40%-50% . ✅二、达人分层矩阵：不是铺得越多越好，而是分层匹配 . ✅三、货品规划：把 \"对的产品\" 交给 \"对的达人\" . ✅四、佣","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7693587763165562545","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7693587763165562545","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0135","question_id":"CQ-Q0135","citation_id":"smp-baeb1756d59c46e79df5a85f9db27d95:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","